# Reference implementation cloned for comparison, not part of this package
CT-and-MR-Perfusion-Tool/

# De-identification artefacts. subject_crosswalk.json maps pseudonyms back to
# DICOM PatientNames and deid_salt makes those pseudonyms reversible by anyone
# holding it; neither belongs in the repository, and both are normally written
# outside it. Listed here so a stray copy cannot be committed by accident.
subject_crosswalk.json
.deid_salt
deid_salt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Validation and paper work -- local only
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is the pipeline: what is needed to run the tool and to use
# it as a library inside someone else's pipeline. The cohort harness, the
# paper analysis and their outputs live in the working directory so they can
# still be run from the repo root, but they are not part of the package and
# are not published.
tools/
paper_analysis.ipynb
PAPER_RESULTS.md
paper_outputs/

